# Java 21 / Spring Boot

## Before editing
- Read only the controller/service/repository layer involved + its DTO/entity.
- Entry: `*Application.java`; config in `application.yml` / `application-*.yml`.

## Patterns
- Constructor injection; no field `@Autowired`.
- `@Transactional` on service layer only.
- DTOs for API boundaries; entities never exposed directly.

## Scope
- Never index or read `target/`, `.gradle/`, or `build/`.
- Flyway/Liquibase: read only the specific migration file being changed.
